			"notes": "#for before updates check modrinth page\n\n\n## **Koper_Mod 0.8 – The Magic Update**\n\n\n### **New Magic System**\n\n* **New Staffs:** Added Coperk, Haotic, Shroom, and Antishroom staffs.\n* **Requirements:** * To use **Coperk** or **Haotic** staffs, you need **Lapised Amethyst**.\n* To use the **Shroom** staff, you need **Shroomed Lapised Amethyst**.\n* To use the **Antishroom** staff, you need **Antishroomed Lapised Amethyst**.\n\n\n* **Magic Table:** A new workstation used to upgrade your wands and imbue them with orbs.\n* **Orbs:** Found in world structures.\n* **Power Orbs:** Grant unique spells to your staff (leveled).\n* **Upgrade Orbs:** Permanently boost the base stats of your wand.\n\n\n* **Magic Scrolls:** Special items found in structures. You can use them to cast a spell by clicking, but they have a limited capacity—**after 4 casts, the scroll breaks**.\n* **Mana System:** Added a mana bar based on the `max_mana` attribute. Base mana is **100**, which regenerates over time or instantly upon sleeping.\n* **Animations:** Added a custom spell-casting animation for the player.\n\n### **Trinkets (Requires Trinkets API)**\n\n* **Rings & Necklaces:** Now available in **Normal** and **Cursed** variants.\n* **Normal:** Provides a steady buff.\n* **Cursed:** Offers much stronger buffs but comes with a significant penalty/drawback.\n* *Note: Balancing is currently a work-in-progress. and all trinket items are found in structures*\n\n\n\n### **Commands & Technical Changes**\n\n* **New Command:** `/GO [type]` (Admin only, case-sensitive).\n* Usage: `/GO power`, `/GO upgrade`, `/GO trinket`, or `/GO scroll`.\n* Effect: Gives the player a random item of the chosen category.\n\n\n* **Shrooming Effect:** Refactored and upgraded, though still considered experimental. Expect further fixes soon.\n\n### **Dependencies & Compatibility**\n\n* **Required:** trinkets (canary) – Used instead of Accessories becouse i like the ui more of trinkets\n* **Optional:** Player Animation Lib – Required for custom casting animation to display correctly.\n\n---\n\n### **⚠️ Disclaimer**\n\nEverything in this update is currently a bit **experimental**. As a solo developer, I can't catch every bug on my own—I would really appreciate any feedback or bug reports you can provide!"
		},
